<section class="about_rcciit">
	<div class="container-fluid">
		<div class="row align-items-center">
			<div class="col-md-12">
				<h3 class="title">About rcciit</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-5 mt-lg-5 mt-md-4 mt-4">
				<div class="about_rcciit_bg">
					<img src="https://rcciit.edu.in/uploads/home_about/1755170374_aboutbg.jpg" class="img-fluid aboutbg" alt="...">
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-7 mt-lg-5 mt-md-4">
				<div class="sdd">
					<div class="about_rcciit_cont">
						<p>RCC Institute of Information Technology (RCCIIT) was set up in 1999 by the erstwhile Regional Computer Centre (RCC), Calcutta (in JU) as a unique joint venture of NIC, Ministry of Communication &amp; IT, Govt. of India and Dept. of Higher Education, Govt. of West Bengal. In 2003 the lead role of management of RCCIIT was transferred to the State Govt. from Govt. of India.</p>
						<a href="about/" class="more_link mt-lg-4 mt-md-2 mt-2">know more</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="others_subject">
	<div class="container-fluid">
		<div class="row no-gutters">
			<div class="col-md-4">
				<div class="others_subject_cont notice">
					<h3 class="title mb-lg-5 mb-md-4">General Notice</h3>
					<div class="notice_slide owl-carousel owl-theme">
														<div class="item">
									<span class="date">2nd March, 2026</span>
									<!--<h4>Students are requested to fill up the google form (only using institute email ids) after submission and payment of Regular & Backlog Exam Form </h4>-->
